    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_pochnit_iz_stsenariiu_vykorystannia_dlia_brauzera_' => '<p>Start with your use case. For browsing, documents, and video calls, a comfortable keyboard, 16 GB of RAM, and a fast SSD matter most.</p><h2>What to look at</h2><p>Assess display quality, real-world battery life, weight, and the port selection. Don\'t overpay for specs you won\'t use.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_pryklad_tovaru_z_katehorii_krasy_i_zdorovia_korotk' => '<p>An example product from the beauty and health category: a short card, promotional price, specifications, and reviews.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_strong_demo_mahazyn_strong_br_email_demo_example_c' => '<p><strong>Demo store</strong><br>Email: demo@example.com<br>Phone: +380 00 000 00 00</p><p>Replace this information before launching the store.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_strong_modern_commerce_demo_strong_demonstruie_kat' => '<p><strong>Nexora Commerce Demo</strong> showcases the platform\'s catalog, product page, delivery, checkout, SEO, and content features.</p><p>This text is for demonstration purposes and must be replaced with real company data before a public launch.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_strong_neo_x1_strong_zbalansovanyi_suchasnyi_smart' => '<p><strong>Neo X1</strong> is a well-balanced modern smartphone for work, photography, and entertainment. A large OLED display, ample storage, and fast charging make it comfortable to use every day.</p><p>This demo product was created to showcase Nexora Commerce\'s capabilities.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_tse_demo_tekst_pered_publichnym_zapuskom_mahazyn_p' => '<p>This is demo text. Before a public launch, the store must publish its own privacy policy with the real data controller details, processing purposes, and retention periods.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_tse_demonstratsiinyi_tekst_polityky_povernennia_pe' => '<p>This is demo return policy text. Before launching the store, specify the actual terms, timeframes, contacts, and exceptions in accordance with your market\'s legislation.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_u_demo_mozhna_pokazuvaty_bankivskyi_perekaz_oplatu' => '<p>The demo can show bank transfer, cash on delivery, and hosted online acquiring. Card payment data is not stored by the store.</p>',
    'php.modules.demo.application.demoseeder.p_velyka_chasha_zrozumile_keruvannia_ta_hotovi_prohr' => '<p>A large bowl, simple controls, and ready-made programs for everyday meals. A practical demo product for a modern product card.</p>',
